BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Discussion: What is a Just War?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T183000
UID:260724oeKxvmNUWkeGXQz3cIbPHQ
DESCRIPTION:In a time when our nation is engaged in multiple conflicts usi
 ng warfare\, how do we discern what is just and what is not?\n\nSt. Columb
 a’s Inverness Social Justice Ministry is sponsoring What Is a Just War?\
 , a community discussion exploring the Anglican Communion’s Just War pri
 nciples. These timeless guidelines can help us understand today's news and
  inspire faithful\, constructive responses.\n\nAll are invited. All perspe
 ctives are welcome.\n\nThe event takes place Wednesday\, July 29\, from 5:
 30 to 6:30 p.m. at St. Columba’s Inverness\, 12835 Sir Francis Drake Bou
 levard\, Inverness. \n\nGet more information about the Social Justice Min
 istry and more at stcolumbasinverness.org
LOCATION:St. Columba's Inverness
URL:https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/social-justice
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marina Crouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T203000
UID:260722wfrcQseTGEaPGZ0nGT7Tqg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an intimate night of soul\, blues\, Latin soul\, j
 azz\, and Bay Area groove with powerhouse vocalist Marina Crouse\, featuri
 ng acclaimed guitarist Garth Webber.\n\nMarina Crouse is one of the stando
 ut voices on the San Francisco Bay Area music scene. With early classical 
 training and a deeply expressive style\, she brings power\, warmth\, and e
 motional honesty to every song. Her performances move easily between blues
 \, soul\, jazz\, Latin music\, and heartfelt ballads\, all delivered with 
 the kind of presence that makes a small room feel electric.\n\nHer latest 
 album\, Canto de mi corazón\, is her first all-Spanish recording and was 
 released on the Little Village Foundation label\, highlighting the depth\,
  versatility\, and cultural richness of her music.\n\nDoors & Dinner 5:30 
 PM • Show 6:30 PM
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
URL:https://empresstheatre.org/event/marina-crouse-and-garth-webber/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
