BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Solano County Fair at the Community Listening Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T180000
UID:260728_n8mPM5iT0SiOdNwWhl4dA
DESCRIPTION:The Solano County Fair Association invites community members t
 o help shape the future of their Fair by attending a Community Listening S
 ession with Chief Executive Officer Tom Keaney on Wednesday\, July 29\, at
  6:00 p.m. in Gibson Hall \\(The Winners' Circle\\) at the Solano County F
 airgrounds.\n\nThe evening will provide an opportunity for residents\, fai
 r supporters\, exhibitors\, volunteers\, community partners\, and the publ
 ic to connect directly with Fair leadership\, share ideas\, ask questions\
 , and discuss the future of the Solano County Fair.\n\nThe meeting will be
 gin with introductory remarks from CEO Tom Keaney\, followed by an open se
 ssion and public comment. The focus of the evening will be on hearing dire
 ctly from the community about what they value most\, what they'd like to s
 ee in the years ahead\, and how the Fair can continue to grow as a cherish
 ed tradition for Solano County.\n\n"Over the past several months\, there h
 as been significant community conversation surrounding the Fairgrounds\," 
 said Keaney. "As we move forward\, I want to make sure we also focus on wh
 at brings us together—the Solano County Fair. This is your Fair\, and I 
 want to hear your ideas\, your priorities\, and your vision for its future
 . Together\, we can continue building an event that reflects the pride\, t
 raditions\, and aspirations of our community."\n\nNo formal presentation o
 r action items are planned. Instead\, the evening is intended to foster op
 en dialogue and gather community feedback that will help inform future Fai
 r programming\, experiences\, and community engagement.\n\nThe Community L
 istening Session is free and open to the public. Everyone with an interest
  in the future of the Solano County Fair is encouraged to attend.
LOCATION:Solano County Fairgrounds
URL:https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1675573511238963&set=pb.100063589
 901787.-2207520000
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
