BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Wednesday Night Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T000000
UID:260526YNmYIHRghUKsWj7uyc-_hw
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Wednesday Night Market is a beloved free commun
 ity event that's been a tradition for 37 years and brings people together 
 to celebrate local culture\, small businesses\, and the vibrant spirit of 
 downtown. Our mission is to create an inclusive\, welcoming public space w
 here residents and visitors can gather to enjoy great food\, live entertai
 nment\, and unique local vendors while supporting the economic and social 
 health of our city. This lively open-air street fair features a curated se
 lection of local artisans\, farmers\, food vendors\, and community organiz
 ations. Guests can enjoy live music and performances\, explore handmade go
 ods\, discover fresh local products\, and connect with the people who make
  Sonoma County special. Families are especially welcome. The Market includ
 es a dedicated Kids Zone with free activities for children\, interactive e
 xperiences\, and opportunities for learning and play. Local nonprofit orga
 nizations also participate each week\, sharing information about their pro
 grams and helping strengthen connections across the community. The Wednesd
 ay Night Market is more than an event-it's a celebration of community\, cr
 eativity\, and the local businesses and organizations that help Santa Rosa
  thrive.
LOCATION:Old Courthouse Square
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Full Moon Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T194500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T214500
UID:260306NT6Pm8rFbUCns9XTkEMv-A
DESCRIPTION:Come play on the river at night.\n\nJoin The Floathouse for a 
 magical evening paddle on the Petaluma River—Petaluma’s Longest Park
 —timed to catch the full moon rising over the wetlands just south of dow
 ntown. As twilight fades\, we’ll head out together in Hobie pedal kayaks
  for a relaxed\, guided glide that turns nighttime into playtime.\n\nThese
  pedal-powered kayaks make the journey smooth and easy\, even if there’s
  a breeze or moving tide. We’ll cruise about a mile and a half downriver
  to the perfect moonrise vantage point\, where calm water\, wide skies\, a
 nd glowing reflections set the scene.\n\nThis is a social\, feel-good outd
 oor experience designed for anyone looking for something a little differen
 t to do after dark—part nature\, part adventure\, part pure vibe.\n\n$60
  per person includes everything: • Hobie pedal kayak • PFD and safety 
 lights • Experienced local guide • A memorable\, moonlit river experie
 nce\n\n✨ Easy. Playful. Peaceful. Spend your evening under the full moon
 —on the water.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/petaluma-river-full-moo
 n-paddle/17974383/2026-07-29T19
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
