DESCRIPTION:Modern security starts with understanding the threats. Are you
  just an ordinary person? Are you engaged in 1st Amendment activity that\,
  none-the-less\, might invite scrutiny?\n\nThis is a two-fold talk\, the f
 irst half is the defenses everyone needs against the crooks and criminals 
 that stalk our everyday lives. The second then discusses both the technolo
 gies and legal frameworks that may affect someone who participates in cons
 titutionally protected but none-the-less investigated behavior.
