 ing:\n\n▪ Principals and Vice Principals\n\n▪ Teachers: Spanish-speaki
 ng\, Art\, Band\, Special Ed\, and more\n\n▪ High School Athletic Direct
 or\n\n▪ Expanded Learning Program Assistant\n\n▪ Bus Drivers\n\n▪ Ma
 ny more!\n\nTo see a list of all current positions\, please visit our webs
 ite at https://www.vcusd.org/about-us/careers\n\nRemember to bring your re
