BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women's Social & Business Networking | Bloom & Belong Summer Garde
 n Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T200000
UID:260722osYoeSaTTkiM2VZyRvwqbw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a summer garden party at the Community Garden outs
 ide of Petaluma Dental Group and Allume Med Spa. This special gathering is
  designed for women in Sonoma County who are looking to make new friends\,
  build meaningful connections\, and reflect on where they've been and wher
 e they're headed. Together\, we'll celebrate our accomplishments from the 
 first half of the year while planting seeds of possibility for the months 
 ahead.\n\nLocation: 1301 Southpoint Blvd\, Petaluma\, CA 94954\n\nTime: 6:
 00 - 8:00 PM\n\nAttire: Come wearing what ever makes you feel confident an
 d comfortable. No formal “garden party” outfits required.\n\nYour tick
 et includes:\n\nA private Instagram group chat: Connect with other attende
 es before the event so you can arrive already recognizing friendly faces. 
 Everyone is encouraged to follow one another and continue building relatio
 nships long after the event ends.\n\nCommunity Introductions: We'll gather
  in a circle to introduce ourselves and learn more about everyone in atten
 dance. If you're a local business owner\, this will be your opportunity to
  share about your business with the group.\n\nGuided Reflection Stations: 
 Throughout the garden\, you'll find interactive stations featuring thought
 ful prompts designed to help you celebrate your wins\, reflect on your gro
 wth\, and clarify your goals for the rest of 2026. Each guest will receive
  a worksheet to complete and take home as a reminder of the intentions the
 y set.\n\nConnection & Conversation: Share your dreams\, ideas\, and goals
  with like-minded women who believe in supporting one another. You never k
 now what opportunities\, friendships\, or collaborations may grow from a s
 imple conversation.\n\nSeasonal Refreshments: Enjoy beautiful handcrafted 
 mocktails provided by Mexology\, along with additional beverages and light
  bites while mingling throughout the garden.
LOCATION:Allume Med Spa
URL:https://www.shecanclub.com/shop/p/bloom-and-belong
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
