 er games\, trampolines\, food trucks\, and festive tunes. July 16 – Rock
  the Wall Take on the rock wall\, enjoy face painting\, delicious food\, a
 nd an evening of music and adventure. July 30 – Controllers & Karaoke Ch
 allenge your friends in the video game truck\, sing your favorite songs du
 ring karaoke\, and dance the night away. What to Expect Rotating lineup of
  local food trucks Live DJ and music Interactive games and attractions ‍
  ‍ ‍ Family-friendly activities/facepainter  A fun\, safe\, and welcom
 ing atmosphere Special Thanks Bite Night Thursdays are made possible throu
 gh the support of the City of Vallejo and Measure P\, helping provide free
  recreation opportunities and community events for Vallejo families throug
 hout the summer. Their investment in youth\, families\, and community enga
 gement helps make events like these accessible to everyone. Friendly Remin
 ders ✅ Admission is FREE ✅ Food and beverages available for purchase f
 rom participating vendors ✅ Children must be supervised by an adult ✅ 
 Bring your friends\, family\, and summer spirit! ✅ Food truck lineup wil
