BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Social Contractors: Return To Rock Spancky's Bar!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T000000
UID:260728oezNQ7CbF0y4vjImxiYjhg
DESCRIPTION:….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local band 
 The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…” -
  Argus-Courier\, 2025\n\nThe Social Contractors return to rock Spancky's B
 ar from 9 PM until midnight with their upbeat blend of original rock and t
 asteful interpretations of classic 60-90s hits from the bands you know and
  love \\(Beatles\, Hendrix\, Pink Floyd\, Cream\, Stevie Wonder\, Steve Mi
 ller\, Foreigner\, Police\, Men At Work\, Steely Dan\, Tom Petty\, Tears F
 or Fears\, U2\, and more\\).\n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, searing 
 guitar and sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or just gre
 at dynamic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't disappoint
 .\n\nThe Social Contractors lineup for this free live performance features
  band founder and songwriter\, Jason E Davies \\(lead vocals/lead guitar\\
