SUMMARY:Back pOrchEstra at Petaluma Theatre Square Plaza\, Fri. eve. July 
 31 6:00pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T200000
UID:260728KJ-1WOS3BUeMUoTHgyHsVg
DESCRIPTION:Back pOrchEstra at Petaluma Theatre Square Plaza\, Fri. eve. J
 uly 31\, 6:00-8:00 pm\n\n...with Candy Girard\, Gary Potterton\, Luis Rodr
 iguez\, Jen Rund and Tim Eschliman\n\n101 Second St\, Petaluma\, CA 94952\
 n\nOutdoor event\, we'll have plenty roots rock\, cajun\, 2-beat\, western
  swing and country blues originals and historic numbers... on resonator gu
 itar\, violin\, bass\, drums & electric guitar.\n\nWe have a single out!: 
 https://orcd.co/lxz1l6v "I'm Wild About My Lovin'"\, celebrating the new "
 Stories In The Heart" album\, hear the whole thing now!: https://orcd.co/5
 xga7nr\n\n"...What sets 'Stories In The Heart' apart is its sense of balan
 ce. Resonator guitar\, violin\, bass\, drums\, percussion\, dobro\, and Te
 lecaster create a flexible\, roots-forward palette that allows Back Porche
 stra to move between styles fluidly. The songs echo traditions without ree
 nacting them\, keeping one foot in the past and the other firmly planted i
 n the present." - Vince's Hot Picks \\(Best of 2026\\) New Releases Now\n\
 n"The guitars slam like saloon doors\, the violin traces lines that oscill
 ate between melancholy and jubilation\, the rhythm section moves forward w
 ith a tranquil groove that never rushes but never falters... Back pOrchEst
 ra delivers a luminous\, earthy\, profoundly human record. An album that m
 akes you want to sit on a porch\, watch the sunset\, and let the stories d
 o their work...." - Fred Delforge\, Zicazine \\(translated from French\\)\
 n\nBack pOrchEstra is a compact Shelter-in-Place-inspired musical combo ..
 ..going back to the basics... Formed for the first time the locked-down su
 mmer of 2020. The band draws from new original material as well as reworke
 d classics by Hank Williams\, Taj Mahal\, Dan Hicks\, Big Bill Broonzy\, B
 ob Wills\, Bobby Charles ...even Christmas Jug Band tunes\n\n... check out
  the "Dusty Road I'm On" video: https://youtu.be/jj0IIkUyrE4 ...a twangy r
 oots rock number with a Cajun flavor and hints of Jesse Ed Davis and Sid P
 age....\n\nThe previous single\, the Neo-Motown/Levon Helm style "Ever Thi
 nk About It\," is here: https://orcd.co/qo5579q\n\nLPs\, CDs\, and USB-Mus
 ic Cards available all over\, including https://www.globerecords.com\n\nmo
 re at... https://www.BackpOrchEstra.com\n\nBandCamp: https://backporchestr
 a.bandcamp.com\n\nyouTube: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOTwG2XE
 iO2O8c0dEI-7hlpI8nr7apiNf\n\nBluesky: https://bsky.app/profile/backporches
 tra.bsky.social\n\nReverb Nation: https://www.reverbnation.com/backporches
 tra\n\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BackPorchEstra/\n\nInstagram: ht
 tps://www.instagram.com/backporchestra/\n\n\\#rootsrock\n\n\\#americanroot
 smusic\n\n\\#americanamusic\n\n\\#rockabillymusic\n\n\\#twangyguitar\n\n\\
 #backporchestra\n\n\\#acousticmusic\n\n\\#adultalbumalternative\n\n\\#sing
 ersongwriter\n\n\\#folkmusic\n\n\\#folkrock
LOCATION:Theater Square Plaza
URL:https://www.BackpOrchEstra.com/shows.html
