UID:260728LCQRdC4OZE6O4BRFNNLkAA
DESCRIPTION:Max Vogel is a country artist from Windsor\, California\, who 
 has been singing and playing music his entire life. He picked up a guitar 
 at 15 years old and hasn’t put it down since\, spending years honing his
  craft as a singer\, songwriter\, and performer.\n\nInspired by artists li
 ke Garth Brooks\, Alan Jackson\, Randy Travis\, Eric Church\, Zac Brown Ba
 nd\, and Brooks & Dunn\, Max blends traditional country roots with a moder
 n edge. His music is built on honest storytelling\, strong melodies\, and 
 the kind of songs that bring people together.\n\nAfter many years performi
 ng as a solo artist\, Max recently joined forces with a talented group of 
 musicians to form Max Vogel & the Pickups. Together\, they bring a high-en
 ergy country show filled with heartfelt originals\, crowd-favorite country
  anthems\, and a genuine connection with every audience they play for.\n\n
 With a passion for music\, family\, and community\, Max continues carving 
 his path in the country music scene while keeping the spirit of country mu
 sic alive everywhere the band plays.\n\nSeth Burgess teaches popular two-s
 tep and popular western swing dance lessons in the Santa Rosa area. He reg
 ularly hosts multi-week\, progressive dance series and community workshops
  at the historic Alexander Valley Community Hall in Geyserville. \n\nHis 
 classes focus on traditional\, boot-scootin' partner dancing rather than l
 ine dancing\, making them a great way to prep for local social events.\n\n
 All Ages\n\n$15
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse
URL:https://www.rionidoroadhouse.com/calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
