 ohnert Park on August 1 from 10-12 at Cotati City Hall to learn sustainabl
 e business principles and to network with other local businesses. Green bu
 siness champion\, Oliver's Markets\, shares their best practices. Find out
  how you can become a Certified Green Business from the County of Sonoma a
 nd hear about the local business landscape with the Cotati and Rohnert Par
 k Chambers of Commerce. Attendance is free and refreshments/swag will be 
 offered to all attendees\, as well as the opportunity to win an Oliver’s
  Markets gift card door prize!
