DESCRIPTION:Turn up the blues and bring your appetite at Double Barrel\, B
 acon & Blues. In celebration of International Blues Day\, we’re pairing 
 soulful live blues music with Priest Ranch wines and everyone’s favorite
  indulgence—bacon. Spend the afternoon enjoying a curated selection of b
 acon and wine pairings\, exclusive bacon-inspired bites\, and special menu
  features from The Kitchen at Priest Ranch. Raise a glass\, savor smoky fl
 avors\, and soak in the sounds of live blues as we celebrate one of the mo
 st delicious pairings of all time.\n\nReserve your spot today and be the f
 irst to taste the 2023 Double Barrel while enjoying an unforgettable after
 noon of blues\, bacon\, and bold Napa Valley wines.
