DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T180000
UID:260713m6n3yWBf_0SrfZmVAD8GkA
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for hard hits and a whole lot of North Bay derby spi
 rit! 🛼💥 Join us for our first North Bay Derby bout at Sonoma State U
 niversity as we bring inclusive\, high-energy roller derby to the track.\n
 \nPlease note location: Sonoma State University Main Gymnasium \\(Wolves D
 en\\)\n\n2:00 pm: North Bay Derby vs Black Skaters with Attitude\n\n4:00 p
 m: North Bay Derby's home teams face off for the first time!\n\nYour ticke
 t supports a community where skaters of all skill levels can learn\, compe
 te\, and have fun. Please note: tickets will be available for $25 adults\,
  $15 kids and seniors at the door after online sales have ended.\n\nIf you
