DESCRIPTION:Rediscover the spirit of summer with an elevated\, wine countr
 y twist on the classic camp experience. Set against the dramatic terraced 
 vineyards of the Stags Leap District\, this evening of “Glamping in the 
 District” combines nostalgia with world-class hospitality for an unforge
 ttable al fresco celebration.\n\nThe Main Event: Your evening begins with 
 a vibrant\, walk-around reception through our Exploration Vineyard featuri
 ng our latest new release wines. Savor the spirit of Camp Pine Ridge throu
 gh a variety of stations featuring locally sourced provisions and elevated
  outdoor fare.\n\nEntertainment & Exploration: As the golden hour sets in\
 , stroll through our garden\, engage in elevated camp-inspired games\, toa
 st up s’mores as you mingle with other Pine Ridge Campers or settle in f
 or a unique “fireside chat” as Estate Winemaker Josh Widaman shares th
 e stories and craftsmanship behind our most storied bottlings.
