BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Cell Sundays: Ken Dewitt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T143000
UID:260727INMM_Wvnpkui9n3dm0b2vA
DESCRIPTION:**Chillax with Sir Uke: Ken Dewitt Live**\n\nJoin us for No Ce
 ll Sundays with Ken Dewitt\, affectionately known as "Sir Uke"—a North B
 ay ukulele player whose warm\, charming style pairs perfectly with a lazy 
 Sunday afternoon.\n\nSir Uke's soothing covers of beloved songs\, played o
 n the enchanting ukulele\, create a laid-back and inviting atmosphere that
  melts away the week's stress. With melodies that drift effortlessly throu
 gh the air\, his music is the perfect soundtrack for unwinding\, sipping w
 ine\, and simply enjoying the moment.\n\nWhether you're sprawled on a blan
 ket under the sun or settled in with a glass of your favorite vintage\, Si
 r Uke delivers exactly what you need: good vibes\, great music\, and zero 
 stress.\n\n**What's No Cell Sundays?**\n\nIt's simple: disconnect from you
 r devices\, reconnect with great wine\, live music\, and the people around
  you. *Check your phone with us at the door and receive a complimentary ta
 sting.* Bring a blanket\, grab a glass\, and spend your Sunday the way it 
 was meant to be spent.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-ken-dewitt
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
