BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lavender Labyrinth Sound Bath Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T200000
UID:260526MukXzRUo5EGL1CM3tCEbRA
DESCRIPTION:Join us in our most dreamy location yet\, in the center of a l
 avender labyrinth for an exquisite sunset sound Bath Experience!\n\nJoin u
 s in our most dreamy location yet\, in the middle of lavender labyrinth at
  sunset!\n\nMondays through October 6th\n\nWe are thrilled to share this m
 agic with you! Let the fragrance of lavender fill and sooth your senses as
  the sound expands your awareness.\n\nSound baths create the space for sel
 f-healing and transformation. The resonance of the instruments is not just
  an auditory experience ~ it's like receiving a full body sound massage.\n
 \nThere will be 8 Gongs\, Crystal singing bowls\, Hand pan\, Mono chord\, 
 Chimes galore\, Ocean drum\, Native drum\, Angelic Vocals & more.The vibra
 tions will transport you on a powerful healing journey!\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Th
 e sound bath starts at 7pm. Gates close at 6:45 PM. Please be Mindful of t
 iming. You will need time to park\, walk up and set up. You are welcome to
  come walk the labyrinth and visit the Farm Stand from 6 pm onward. Please
  check the hourly weather so you are prepaired. You will be lying on the g
 rass\, so please bring all that you will need to feel cozy and warm\, "yog
 a mat" or camping pad\, "Blanket" or sleeping bag\, a pillow\, eye mask\, 
 and water bottle. Wonderful Lavender Eye Masks will be available to purcha
 se for $25 by the Bees & Blooms Farm Stand.\n\nIf we have environmental Ci
 rcumstance such as rain or unhealthy air quality due to fires we will post
 pone to Wednesday of the same week and your tickets will roll over to that
  day. If these conditions are present it is your responsibility to monitor
  your emails\\(also junk/spam\\) for notifications. In these force of natu
 re situations Tickets are not refundable but are transferable! Your unders
 tanding and cooperation is greatly appreciated.\n\nPlease be informed that
  there are bee hives on site and there may be bees on the lavender plants.
  If you are allergic to bee stings\, bring your Epipen. An incident is unl
 ikely\, but best to be prepared. Also\, at some point\, probably mid July 
 the Lavender will began to be harvested so there may be less lavender towa
 rds the end of the month.Full Bloom occurs mid June. The last sound bath o
 f the Lavender season will be Oct. 6th. The labyrinth & farm will be beaut
 iful however the Lavender will be reaching the end of its cycle around mid
 . July. You will walk through many rows of a varity of blooming flowers on
  you way from parking.\n\nOnly disability trained Registered Service dogs 
 are permitted because of the animals on the farm and the nature of the Sou
 nd Bath. Your understanding is appreciated. Also\, please no children unde
 r 10 years of age.\n\nLabyrinths represent a metaphor for your life path a
 nd the journey you are making. While walking the path of the labyrinth\, e
 ither alone or with a group\, focus on your feelings and emotions to allow
  you to connect with yourself. You may also want to choose a meditation th
 at you are comfortable with in order to clear and quiet your mind. The use
 s of a labyrinth are many\; relief from stress and anxiety\, healing\, med
 itation\, problem solving\, enhancing intuition\, expanding thought proces
 ses\, communicating with the Divine\, balancing mind\, body and spirit\, l
 etting go of unwanted energies\, obtaining goals\, celebrating and remembe
 ring others\, building trust in yourself or others\, and coping with grief
 \, sorrow and loss. The labyrinth is an ancient symbol that relates to who
 leness. It combines the imagery of the circle and the spiral into a meande
 ring but purposeful path. The Labyrinth represents a journey to our own ce
 nter and back again out into the world. Labyrinths have long been used as 
 meditation and prayer tools.\n\nLooking forward to sharing this Extraordin
 ary Experience with you! In Gratitude
LOCATION:Bees n blooms
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1985876807991?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
