  that's perfect to wear\, gift\, and knit again.\n\nIn this workshop you'l
 l:\n\nLearn how to read and follow a knitting pattern\n\nPractice increase
 s and decreases while shaping your scarf\n\nBuild the skills and confidenc
 e to take on future knitting projects\n\nDesigned for students who are com
 fortable with the knit stitch and basic knitting skills. Materials availab
 le for purchase at Gather.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
