BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Santa Rosa Original Certified Farmers Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T000000
UID:260606oE7iX_oSAkKpHmc3U9L56A
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Original Certified Farmers Market is a year-rou
 nd Saturday tradition in Sonoma County\, bringing together local farmers\,
  ranchers\, food artisans\, and neighbors from 8:30 a.m. to 1 p.m. This is
  not just a place to shop\, it's a place to connect directly with the peop
 le who grow your food. As a Slow Food Sonoma County award recipient\, the 
 market prioritizes integrity\, seasonality\, and true farm-to-community re
 lationships. Expect peak-season produce harvested just hours before market
 \, pasture-raised meats\, fresh flowers\, artisan breads\, handcrafted goo
 ds\, and thoughtfully prepared foods that reflect the region's agricultura
 l richness. Visitors can stroll the vibrant open-air market\, sample local
  flavors\, and experience Sonoma County's food culture in its most authent
 ic form. Families\, chefs\, and weekend explorers alike gather here to dis
 cover what's growing now and to support small farms that keep our local fo
 od system strong. Open every Saturday\, rain or shine\, the Santa Rosa Ori
 ginal Certified Farmers Market is a cornerstone of the community and a mus
 t-visit stop for anyone wanting to taste\, shop\, and experience Sonoma Co
 unty at its freshest.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
