DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T230000
UID:260702oHAGu6jkuk6P2VpPl4NZKw
DESCRIPTION:Pimp Bizkit is a dynamic tribute band based in Los Angeles\, C
 alifornia\, dedicated to celebrating the iconic sound and energy of the Am
 erican nu-metal pioneers Limp Bizkit. Formed in 2024\, by Raanen “Raan O
 tto” Bozzio\, son of legendary drummer Terry Bozzio(Frank Zappa\, Missin
 g Persons)\, along with prominent LA session musicians\, “Sean Durst” 
 Giebitz\, “Jack Borland” Glazer\, and “Curt Rivers” Remington—wh
 o shared a deep appreciation for Limp Bizkit’s genre-defining blend of r
 ap\, metal\, and high-octane live performances. Pimp Bizkit quickly carved
  out a niche in the Southern California music scene\, delivering electrify
 ing shows that capture the raw intensity\, rebellious spirit\, and nostalg
 ic vibe of the late ‘90s and early 2000s nu-metal era. PLUS SPECIAL GUES
 T!\n\n Live Music starts at 8PM  Free Popcorn! $20 LIMITED SEATING!!!\n\
 nPurchase a VIP table for 4 for $100 (only 6 available) Snag a table for 4
  with preferred seating\, your own private call button to summon service\,
  and your first round of beer/cider (or a bottle of wine) for only $100! 2
 1+\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times 
 ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pimp-bizkit-nu-metal-tribute-to-limp-bizk
 it-tickets-1992791472940?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
