BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:H&L Live: Burrows & Dilbeck
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T183000
UID:260607pG37-nZnJEKD4oWbhSgeWg
DESCRIPTION:**H&L Live: Burrows & Dilbeck**\n\nGet ready for an evening of
  soul\, funk\, and masterful songwriting as Burrows & Dilbeck take the sta
 ge for H&L Live.\n\nSpencer Burrows and Kris Dilbeck are the powerhouse du
 o behind North Bay's legendary super-funk-rock band Frobeck\, which earned
  two North Bay Music Awards over their 13-year run. These Sonoma State Uni
 versity and Berklee College of Music alumni have opened for internationall
 y known acts including WAR\, Los Lonely Boys\, Ivan Neville's Dumpstaphunk
 \, Bootsy Collins\, and the Sons of Champlin.\n\nWith seven full-length al
 bums under their belt\, Burrows and Dilbeck have harnessed their soul\, fu
 nk\, and pop-rock influences into a unique sound that's earned praise from
  music legends. Bill Champlin of Chicago calls Spencer "one of the best si
 ngers I've ever heard... ever\," while Emilio Castillo of Tower of Power p
 raises their "powerful vocals" and "real strong songwriting."\n\nAfter ret
 iring the Frobeck name in 2018\, this duo dug deeper into their passion fo
 r songwriting and performing—creating music that speaks loudest to their
  souls. Now they're bringing that passion to our vineyard stage.\n\n**What
  to Know:**\n\n**Admission is free** - just show up and enjoy\n\n**Pizza &
  Chill Red:** Fresh wood-fired pizza paired with our new Chill Red\n\n**Ou
 tdoor seating** - Lawn and picnic area available (bring blankets encourage
 d)\n\n**All ages welcome** - Family-friendly event\n\n**Wine available** f
 or purchase by the glass or bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live at its best: world-
 class musicians\, golden hour timing\, and the Russian River Valley as you
 r backdrop. Come early\, stay late\, and experience why the North Bay musi
 c scene is legendary.\n\n**Learn more about Burrows & Dilbeck:** burrowsan
 ddilbeck.com
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-burrows-dilbeck
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
