BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music in the Vineyards | Paired Voices
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T190000
UID:260511UM-wxhvQ_ky0aWpqOH9ncQ
DESCRIPTION:From the theatrical flair of Jacques Offenbach to the cinemati
 c intensity of Miklos Rozsa\, this concert begins with intimate conversati
 ons between paired instruments and concludes with a joyful arrangement of 
 Mozart's Sinfonia Concertante.\n\nPROGRAM\n\nJacques Offenbach \\(1819-188
 0\\): Duo for two Cellos Op. 54 no. 2\n\nRainer Eudeikis\, Joshua McClendo
 n\, cello\n\nPaul Coletti \\(b. 1959\\): Moonlight Journey for two Violas\
 n\nJordan Bak\, Devin Moore\, viola\n\nMiklos Rozsa \\(1907-1995\\): Sonat
 a for two Violins Op. 15\n\nHye-Jin Kim\, Phoenix Avalon\, violin\n\nINTER
 MISSION - wine generously provided by Maxville Winery\n\nWolfgang Amadeus 
 Mozart \\(1756-1791\\): Grande Sestetto Concertante K. 364\n\nEunice Kim\,
  Adrian Steele\, violin\n\nDevin Moore\, John Crowley\, viola\n\nJoshua Mc
 Clendon\, Gabriel Hennebury\, cello\n\nFor the most up-to-date program\, a
 rtist info\, and ticket availability\, click the ticket link to visit the 
 event page.\n\nThis concert is presented as part of the 32nd Annual Season
  of the Napa Valley Chamber Music Festival from August 2-23\, 2026. To lea
 rn more about Music in the Vineyards and the 2026 festival\, navigate to h
 ttps://www.musicinthevineyards.org/events/?utmsource=fullcalendar&utmmediu
 m=referral&utmcampaign=2026festival.
LOCATION:Maxville Winery
URL:https://www.musicinthevineyards.org/?utm_source=fullcalendar&utm_mediu
 m=referral
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
