DESCRIPTION:Art Escape is rolling over to Sonoma Botanical Garden with Art
  Van Gogh\, our mobile art studio!\n\nJoin us for crafts and creative fun 
 for all ages. Our wonderful teachers\, Susan & Cristina\, will guide you i
 n creating Mini Garden Nichos \\(Matchbox Spirit Shrines\\).\n\nParticipan
 ts will transform small matchboxes into miniature “nichos”—tiny shad
 ow box shrines inspired by Mexican folk art traditions. The outside will b
 e decorated with bright floral borders and bold patterns\, while inside ea
 ch box will hold a small symbolic drawing or cut-out “spirit guide” \\
 (animal\, flower\, sun\, etc.\\). This quiet\, reflective project invites 
 artists of all ages to create a personal\, pocket-sized tribute to nature 
 and imagination.\n\nRSVP to us at info@artescapesonoma.com to join for FRE
 E!
