DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260811T200000
UID:260628xkZY1n17XEuljLMihnnsBQ
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Cassie B is a
  San Diego-based singer\, dancer\, and bandleader known for energetic perf
 ormances with her group\, the Cassie B Project. A San Diego native\, she g
 rew up in musical theater\, danced with Culture Shock\, and spent 8.5 year
 s performing at SeaWorld. Her band plays top 40\, motown\, and pop hits fo
 r events and serves as the Padres house band. With show stopping talent an
 d extreme passion\, Cassie B stops at nothing to create an extraordinary e
 xperience you'll never forget.\n\nTuesdays in the Plaza is hosted by the C
 ity of Healdsburg Community Services. A very special thank you to Hotel Tr
 io for their generous sponsorship.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
