BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Mamma Mia!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T220000
UID:260517oIc7wvucTUKJs0k4DTMy7g
DESCRIPTION:The global smash hit is coming to Sonoma for the very first ti
 me! Set on a sun-drenched Greek island\, *Mamma Mia!* follows a young br
 ide-to-be on a quest to discover the identity of her father — bringing t
 hree very unexpected guests from her mother’s past back into their lives
 . Fueled by ABBA’s greatest hits (including “Dancing Queen\,” “Ma
 mma Mia\,” “The Winner Takes It All\,” and more)\, this joyful tale 
 of family\, friendship\, love\, and second chances has captured the hearts
  of millions worldwide. With its large cast\, explosive dance numbers\, no
 nstop humor\, and irresistible score\, *Mamma Mia!* promises to be one o
 f the biggest and most unforgettable productions in Transcendence history.
 \n\n*Mamma Mia!* is presented through special arrangement with Music Thea
 tre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also sup
 plied by MTI. www.mtishows.com
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://transcendencetheatre.org/whats-on/mamma-mia/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Greg Lamboy - Live Every 2nd Thursday at Finnegan's Marin
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T210000
UID:260225v5v7ksF-FEaoTcEzBFljbg
DESCRIPTION:Greg Lamboy has called Finnegan's Marin home for over a decade
 . Every second Thursday of the month\, this Tiburon-based troubadour settl
 es into the warmly lit corner of Novato's beloved neighborhood pub and doe
 s what he does best: connects. An accomplished guitarist and award-winning
  songwriter\, Lamboy has earned his stripes across the Bay Area scene both
  as a solo artist and as frontman of Pacific Standard\, his soulful Americ
 ana band. His five acclaimed albums draw praise for melodies that are pitc
 h-perfect and lyrics that feel like they were written specifically for you
 . At Finnegan's\, a lively Irish pub and American bar and grill along a tr
 ee-lined street in downtown Novato\, Lamboy's intimate style is perfectly 
 at home. No pretense. No distance. Just a strong clear voice\, commanding 
 guitar\, and songs that\, as one critic put it\, lift you above the everyd
 ay. Come early\, grab a pint\, and let the music find you. https://greglam
 boy.com/\n\n*Every second Thursday of the month | Finnegan's Marin\, 877 G
 rant Ave\, Novato | Free*
LOCATION:Finnegan's Marin
URL:https://www.finnegansmarin.com/events-calendar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
