DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting\, collaborative event where you will c
 onnect with other impactful women\, celebrate your accomplishments\, and e
 xpand your visibility in San Luis Obispo County while tapping into a natio
 nal network. We've teamed up with the Atascadero Chamber to help bring our
  Women of Influence North County \\(wINC\\) Connect Mixer to life! Registe
 r now\, and we'll see you on Thursday\, August 13th\, from 5:30 - 7:00 PM 
 at the Tea Trolley. NAWBO and non-NAWBO members are welcome to attend free
  of charge!  At our Connect Mixer\, you will: Connect with women who are s
 erious about growing their business and generous about sharing their exper
 ience. Be celebrated for your accomplishments\, and leave with the confide
 nce to aim even higher. Expand your visibility in SLO County while tapping
  into a national network. It's North County energy with a national reach. 
 We never apologize for being ambitious about our business here!  Location 
 & Parking Details: Women of Influence North County \\(wINC\\) Connect Mixe
 r takes place at the Tea Trolley \\(5932 Entrada Ave\, Atascadero\\). Ther
 e is free street parking in front of the business and throughout downtown 
 Atascadero.  Future Events: https://my805tix.com/?org=6797d037-cb1c-4d9a-9
 7e7-00420a1e61e3 For Growth & Support: Tap into the NAWBO community and ta
 ke your business beyond your city! Learn more: https://nawbo.org/central-c
 oast-california/membership
