 eturns Friday\, August 14 and Saturday\, August 15 for an unforgettable ev
 ening at the Wild Oak Estate Vineyard in Sonoma. Begin the night with a re
 freshing glass of sangria while taking in vineyard views from the Vineyard
  Portico\, then enjoy award-winning St. Francis wines paired with Spanish-
 style tapas and the sounds of live Flamenco guitar. The elegant estate din
 ing room is transformed with the bold colors and energy of Spanish culture
 . Dinner concludes with a captivating Flamenco dance performance that brin
 gs passion\, rhythm\, and artistry to life. Perfect for lovers of wine\, c
