DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T200000
UID:260711v23tSaUkB0GQTTXKHbdOqg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Latin pop\, reggae\, rock en español\, and Caribb
 ean vibes by the river with Edú Bega Band. Come dance with us in Petaluma
 .\n\nLast summer\, Music By The River brought people together at Grand Cen
 tral Café by the waterfront in Petaluma. Friends gathered\, families spen
 t the evening together\, and before long\, the dance floor had taken on a 
 life of its own.\n\nThat's what this event is all about.\n\nOn August 15\,
  we're bringing it back to Grand Central Café for another evening of Lati
 n pop\, reggae\, rock en español\, and original music performed live by E
 dú Bega Band.\n\nIf you've been to one of our shows before\, you know wha
 t to expect: great music\, good company\, and plenty of reasons to get out
  of your seat.\n\nIf this is your first time joining us\, we'd love to wel
 come you.
LOCATION:Grane Central Cafe
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/music-by-the-river-tickets-1991293724133
