 s Performing Arts Center on August 15th in Rohnert Park! This high-energy 
 live Taylor Swift tribute concert brings the magic of the Eras Tour experi
 ence to Northern California with a full live band\, stunning costumes\, cr
 owd interaction\, and all the fan-favorite songs from every era. Sing alon
 g to hits like “Shake It Off\,” “Love Story\,” “Cruel Summer\,
 ” “Blank Space\,” “You Belong With Me\,” and more in a family-fr
 iendly concert experience perfect for Swifties of all ages. Whether you’
 re looking for concerts in Sonoma County\, live music in Rohnert Park\, Ta
 ylor Swift tribute shows in California\, or fun family events near Santa R
 osa\, Dream Like Taylor delivers an authentic concert-style experience tha
 t audiences can’t stop talking about. Don’t miss one of the top tribut
 e concerts of 2026 at Spreckels Performing Arts Center on Snyder Lane. Gra
 b your tickets now and get ready to dance\, sing\, and Dream Like Taylor a
 ll night long
