BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Convene Summer Concert Series featuring Robert Jones
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T160000
UID:260728lleueDbir0aMYgl1LF4ubw
DESCRIPTION:Live Music Returns to Convene – Complimentary Performance by
  Robert Jones\n\nSpend a relaxing Saturday afternoon at Convene with excep
 tional wines and live acoustic music in the heart of Healdsburg.\n\nJoin u
 s Saturday\, August 15\, from 1:00–4:00 PM for a complimentary live perf
 ormance by acclaimed guitarist Robert Jones. Settle in with your favorite 
 Convene by Dan Kosta or Grail by Dan Kosta wine\, available by the glass o
 r bottle\, and enjoy an afternoon of beautiful music in our tasting lounge
 .\n\nWith roots in Manhattan and a musical soul shaped by Southern Spain\,
  Robert Jones blends fingerstyle acoustic guitar with influences ranging f
 rom Flamenco legend Paco de Lucía to the jazz innovation of Miles Davis a
 nd the artistry of Michael Hedges. His original compositions create an int
 imate\, expressive soundtrack that's perfect for a leisurely afternoon of 
 wine and conversation.\n\nWhether you're joining us for a tasting\, meetin
 g friends\, or simply looking for a memorable way to spend your Saturday\,
  we'd love to welcome you.\n\nReserve your table today and enjoy an unforg
 ettable afternoon of wine and live music at Convene.\n\nSaturday\, August 
 15\, 2026 1:00–4:00 PM Complimentary Concert
LOCATION:Convene by Dan Kosta
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/156165/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour - The Ukulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T180000
UID:2607224JRVACi2QEGgdtf6ngJzeQ
DESCRIPTION:Saturday afternoons hit differently at Barrel Proof Lounge.\n\
 nWe open early — 3pm — and hand the room over to Ukulele Ramblers\, a 
 friendly\, talented ukulele collective that turns Happy Hour into a laid-b
 ack\, sing-along hang.\n\nThis is live music and an open uke jam. Bring yo
 ur ukulele if you’ve got one. Bring your voice even if you don’t. The 
 Ramblers lead the way with familiar tunes\, easy harmonies\, and a welcomi
 ng vibe that makes it just as fun to join in as it is to sit back and list
 en.\n\nNo pressure. No ego. Just good songs\, good people\, and a room tha
 t feels like it belongs to everyone.\n\n Live Music & Open Uke Jam | 3–
 6pm  Happy Hour drinks  Free popcorn  21+\n\n Barrel Proof Lounge 501 
 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nIt’s the kind of afternoon you
  plan to stop by for one drink… and somehow stay for three hours.\n\n**w
 ww.UkuleleRamblers.net**\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for al
 l sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/live-music-happy-hour-the-ukulele-rambler
 s-open-uke-jam-tickets-1485589782029?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
