BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga of the Heart: Embodied Dharma and Mindful Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T160000
UID:2607154dhB8-BkekKse0qYCzVGEw
DESCRIPTION:with Djuna Devereaux\, Anne Cushman and Rolf Gates\n\nIn this 
 time of division\, our hearts long for connection. This daylong is an invi
 tation to tend to that longing—to care for our bodies and distressed ner
 vous systems through embodying the qualities of kindness and compassion. T
 ogether\, we will experience the profound settling and uplift available wh
 en we tend to our emotional bodies within *saṅgha*\, or community.\n\nT
 his daylong integrates Dharma teachings\, meditation\, somatic movement\, 
 and yoga asana. Our movement practices will offer floor-based unwinding to
  release tension and fatigue\, flowing into accessible yoga sequences. Dra
 wing from personal stories and classical Buddhist teachings\, we’ll expl
 ore how the heart qualities—the *brahmavihāras*—can be cultivated th
 rough the body\, offering a foundation for appropriate response to our tim
 es.\n\nAll abilities and levels of experience are welcome.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/yoga-of-the-heart-embo
 died-dharma-and-mindful-yoga-dj2d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
