BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Caesar - Shakespeare in the Park(ing Lot)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T164500
UID:26070376b9GkcYiEmeJxfaE2-b1Q
DESCRIPTION:Free Shakespeare in the Park\\(ing Lot\\). Elections\, ego\, f
 ear. Caesar climbs. The republic fractures.\n\nWe are excited to announce 
 ‘Shakespeare in the Park\\(ing Lot\\)’ 2026.\n\nFree Shakespeare.\n\nC
 aesar\n\nPresented by the Jacobethan Theatre Workshop.\n\nDoors open at 6
 .75pm\, performance at 7.30pm.\n\nOn Sundays\, doors open at 2.15pm with a
 s 3pm start.\n\nDirected by Lukas Raphael\n\nCaesar unfolds in 100 minute
 s of sharp\, modern storytelling. A political system strains under ambitio
 n\, loyalty fractures\, and public rhetoric turns volatile. With minimal s
 taging and contemporary dress\, the play lands uncomfortably close to the 
 present: a study of power\, perception\, and how quickly a republic can sh
 ift.\n\nNo intermission.\n\nA local selection of wine and beer can be purc
 hased in the theater.
LOCATION:Life On Art
URL:https://www.jacobethan.org/parking-lot
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Proprietors Dinner at Quail Hill Ranch at Lynmar Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T200000
UID:260702Ko_E6f727UOSuxMzymPTIg
DESCRIPTION:Join Lynmar Estate Proprietors Lynn and Anisya Fritz at their 
 home at Quail Hill Ranch\, perched just above the winery and overlooking e
 xpansive views of the estate vineyards\, for a memorable alfresco gatherin
 g on the eve of harvest. This special evening captures the electric antici
 pation of the most exciting moment in the winery calendar\, when months of
  careful farming and stewardship culminate in the promise of the vintage t
 o come.\n\nBegin with a relaxing glass of Lynmar wine by the pool\, surrou
 nded by vineyard views at their summer peak\, as Lynn and Anisya share ins
 ights into the growing season and the conditions shaping the upcoming harv
 est. As the sun lowers over the vines\, guests gather for an early\, buffe
 t-style dinner designed for lingering conversation and connection.\n\nSet
  to live music and framed by golden light across the vineyard\, this intim
 ate experience at Quail Hill Ranch offers a rare glimpse into life at Lynm
 ar just before harvest – celebrating community\, seasonality\, and the s
 hared excitement of the vintage ahead.
LOCATION:Quail Hill Ranch at Lynmar Estate
URL:https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/proprietors-dinner/?reservat
 ionDate=2026-08-16&guestCount=2&reservationTime=17:00:00 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
