DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260819T183000
UID:260724LFuwmKoD6E6So1VuFjmwTw
DESCRIPTION:Dive into an extraordinary coastal tasting experience hoste
 d by Master Sommelier Andrea Robinson with special guest and American v
 intner Dan Petroski! Join us at the CIA at Copia for an immersive journey
  through six distinct coastal wines\, featuring pours from Massican\, Cob
 b\, and Hirsch. With every selection\, there will be chef-crafted gourme
 t bites to make the flavors pop. You’ll also discover how ocean bree
 zes and maritime conditions influence vineyard climate\, grape growing\, a
 nd wine style. Secure your tickets today before they sell out!
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
