 ide-to-be on a quest to discover the identity of her father — bringing t
 hree very unexpected guests from her mother’s past back into their lives
 . Fueled by ABBA’s greatest hits (including “Dancing Queen\,” “Ma
 mma Mia\,” “The Winner Takes It All\,” and more)\, this joyful tale 
 of family\, friendship\, love\, and second chances has captured the hearts
