SUMMARY:Lessons For Littles At Montgomery Village
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T120000
UID:260626BpFmS32a2UeuTMa3hvMrKA
DESCRIPTION:Come join the fun at the Village with the Children’s Museum 
 of Sonoma County!\n\nLessons for Littles Series with Children’s Museum o
 f Sonoma County – Saturday\, August 22nd.\n\nCome join us for a fun and 
 educational event at Montgomery Village in the Courtyard hosted by Chil
 dren’s Museum of Sonoma County on Saturday\, August 22nd. Enjoy a morni
 ng of hands-on\, engaging programming where kids will explore and learn th
 rough play.\n\nThis event will take place at the Montgomery Village Courty
 ard\, in the outdoor area in front of Cupcake Children’s Boutique and Ka
 leidoscope Toys. Recommended for ages 4\\+. Space is limited\, please rese
