BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:10 Year Gala Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T170000
UID:2606110RHQgLLRN0mzCtf_-8s5Xg
DESCRIPTION:An evening celebrating a decade of community\, connection\, an
 d growth.\n\nJoin us for a memorable night featuring a gourmet dinner\, li
 ve Klezmer music\, a special appearance by "The Pop Art Rabbi"\, a heartfe
 lt gratitude and award ceremony\, and a silent auction\, as we celebrate t
 he past ten years and look ahead to a bright Jewish future in Petaluma tog
 ether.\n\nWe would be honored to celebrate this milestone with you. \n\n
  Flying Cloud | 1200 Jacobsen Lane\, Petaluma\, CA\n\nSunday\, August 23r
 d\, 5:00pm
LOCATION:Flying Cloud
URL:https://www.jewishpetaluma.com/templates/section_cdo/aid/7200709/jewis
 h/10-Year-Gala-Celebration.htm
