BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Staged Reading Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T183000
UID:2605123XLKnPnkbkijbv31xTg5og
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Valley Players invites you to six unforgettable 
 evenings of theatre — featuring staged readings of bold\, original works
  by both veteran playwrights and emerging talents. Be the first to experie
 nce these sparkling new works brought to life!\n\n**June 14:** *Mother\, I
  Could Kill You* by Barbara A. Silverstone\n\n**June 28:** A Night of One-
