 colas Bearde is a bona fide jazz master who first made his mark more than 
 30 years ago as a founding member of Bobby McFerrin's wildly innovative a 
 capella ensemble\, " Voicestra".  He has released 6 solo CD's on the Right
  Groove Records label\, and has won accolades from critics and jazz audien
 ces worldwide for his "velvet tone" and engaging performances.\n\nBearde's
  music has been critically acclaimed by Jazziz\, Jazz Times\, Jazz Week an
 d All About Jazz\, and as leader has performed and/or recorded around the 
 world from San Francisco and New York to London\, Paris\, Moscow and Bejin
 g with such luminaries such as Vincent Herring\, Eric Alexander\, Josh Nel
