UID:260721BGPab1ktREC1A4sIbNIC-A
DESCRIPTION:Paintings\, Drawings\, Monoprints and Collages by Harry Frank 
 & Sandra Rubin with guest artists Catherine Cruz\, Christine Field\, Bill 
