 oughtfully crafted cocktails and neat pours of some of our favorite whiske
 y offerings. Each course has been designed to complement the whiskey in yo
 ur glass\, culminating in an exclusive tasting of our newest product relea
 se.\n\nGuests may choose between the standard tasting menu or an enhanced 
 experience featuring premium protien additions to select courses. Full men
 u available on website listing.\n\nThursday\, August 27th\, 7:00–9:00 PM
 \n\nThe Vault at Redwood Empire Whiskey Bar\n\n6:30pm Cocktail Hour - join
  us before dinner for a complimentary seasonal welcome cocktail\n\n7:00pm 
 Dinner Service\n\nAdditional Details: Limited seating available. Reservati
 ons required. Must be 21+ to attend. Whiskey Club Members receive 10% off.
LOCATION:Redwood Empire Whiskey Bar & Tasting Room
